  triage:description "AX.6 QA-1 (quality-mgr QA-AX6-R1-1788626395, PR #1204 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T16:56Z) at head 490a6c42a0f3283c251875d9a61fcf99b641c2a2. crates/atm-storage/src/error.rs (test herdr_and_mixed_backend_codes_have_specific_catalog_guidance at lines 661-674) was not extended to the five new doctor codes (RosterNoLead, RosterMultipleLeads, RosterReservedName, TaskStalled, MemberBlocked), so their catalog guidance is unverified. Also raised by ruthless-boundary-qa RBQA-F003. Fix: extend the catalog test to every new code." ;
